(COMMERCIAL LIVESTOCK FEED SUPPLY AGREEMENT \(REF: RVF-2026-089\)) Tj
T* (Effective Date: 1st November 2026 | Jurisdiction: Republic of Kenya) Tj
T* (------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (1. CONTRACTING PARTIES) Tj
T* (Supplier: Rift Valley Livestock Feeds Ltd, Industrial Area, Eldoret.) Tj
T* (Buyer: Nova Swine Breeding & Production Unit, Kaptagat Road, Eldoret.) Tj
T* (Primary Contact \(Supplier\): Herbert Kamau, Operations Director.) Tj
T* (Primary Contact \(Buyer\): Production Foreman, Breeding Section.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS & MONTHLY VOLUMES) Tj
T* (- Sow Lactation Meal \(16.5% Crude Protein\): 180 bags \(50 kg\) per month) Tj
T* (  at KES 3,450 per bag \(Total: KES 621,000 / month\).) Tj
T* (- Pig Creep & Weaner Pellets \(20% Crude Protein\): 120 bags \(50 kg\) per) Tj
T* (  month at KES 4,100 per bag \(Total: KES 492,000 / month\).) Tj
T* (- Gestation & Boar Ration \(14% Crude Protein\): 100 bags \(50 kg\) per) Tj
T* (  month at KES 3,150 per bag \(Total: KES 315,000 / month\).) Tj
T* (Total Contract Monthly Value: KES 1,428,000 \(Inclusive of transport\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. QUALITY ASSURANCE & AFLATOXIN LIMITS) Tj
T* (All feed batches must comply with Kenya Bureau of Standards \(KEBS\) KS EAS 90.) Tj
T* (Maximum permitted total aflatoxin level is 10 parts per billion \(10 ppb\).) Tj
T* (Any batch exceeding 10 ppb aflatoxin or below stated Crude Protein by more) Tj
T* (than 0.8% shall be rejected at the farm gate at the Supplier's full cost.) Tj
ET
