T* (------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T* (4. DELIVERY SCHEDULE & BIOSECURITY PROTOCOL) Tj
T* (Deliveries shall occur every Tuesday by 09:00 AM EAT at the Buyer's) Tj
T* (designated perimeter feed store. Delivery trucks must undergo wheel-dip) Tj
T* (and chassis disinfection using Virkon S \(1:100 dilution\) at the main gate) Tj
T* (barrier. Drivers are strictly prohibited from entering pig pens.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. PAYMENT TERMS & BANKING DETAILS) Tj
T* (Payment Terms: Net 30 days from the date of signed Goods Received Note \(GRN\).) Tj
T* (Early Settlement Discount: 2.5% discount if paid within 7 calendar days.) Tj
T* (Late Payment Penalty: Unpaid invoices past 30 days attract a late fee of) Tj
T* (1.5% per month \(simple interest\) on the overdue KES balance.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6. LATE DELIVERY PENALTIES & EMERGENCY SUBSTITUTION) Tj
T* (If the Supplier fails to deliver within 24 hours of the scheduled Tuesday) Tj
T* (09:00 AM window without prior written notice, a penalty of KES 15,000 per) Tj
T* (delayed day applies, and the Buyer may procure emergency feed from an) Tj
T* (alternative KEBS-certified miller and deduct the price difference.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (7. TERMINATION & DISPUTE RESOLUTION) Tj
T* (Either party may terminate this Agreement with 60 days written notice.) Tj
T* (Disputes not resolved amicably within 14 days shall be referred to) Tj
T* (arbitration in Eldoret under the Chartered Institute of Arbitrators \(Kenya\).) Tj
ET
